[Desktop Entry]
Version=1.0
Name=Betterbird on Wayland
GenericName=Email
Comment=Send and Receive Email
Exec=betterbird-wayland --name betterbird-wayland %u
TryExec=betterbird-wayland
Icon=betterbird
Terminal=false
Type=Application
MimeType=message/rfc822;x-scheme-handler/mailto;
StartupNotify=true
Categories=Network;Email;
Name[cs]=Poštovní klient Betterbird
Name[ca]=Client de correu Betterbird
Name[fi]=Betterbird-sähköposti
Name[fr]=Messagerie Betterbird
Name[pl]=Klient poczty Betterbird
Name[pt_BR]=Cliente de E-mail Betterbird
Name[sv]=E-postklienten Betterbird
Comment[ca]=Llegiu i escriviu correu
Comment[cs]=Čtení a psaní pošty
Comment[de]=Emails lesen und verfassen
Comment[fi]=Lue ja kirjoita sähköposteja
Comment[fr]=Lire et écrire des courriels
Comment[it]=Leggere e scrivere email
Comment[ja]=メールの読み書き
Comment[pl]=Czytanie i wysyłanie e-maili
Comment[pt_BR]=Ler e escrever suas mensagens
Comment[sv]=Läs och skriv e-post
